@host = https://localhost:7081
# Paste the accessToken from the login response here for the [Authorize] requests.
@accessToken = paste-access-token-here

### ===== Auth (api/v1/Auth) =====

### Log in (returns accessToken + refreshToken)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "P@ssw0rd!"
}

### Current user
GET {{host}}/api/v1/Auth/enter
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Refresh tokens
POST {{host}}/api/v1/Auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "paste-refresh-token-here"
}

### ===== Exercises =====

### Search exercises (muscle/tag/difficulty are enum numbers, repeat the key for several)
GET {{host}}/api/exercises/search?twoLetterCulture=en&filterName=press&selectedMuscle=0&selectedMuscle=1

### Exercise details
GET {{host}}/api/exercises?codeNum=1&twoLetterCulture=en

### Exercise details - not found (404)
GET {{host}}/api/exercises?codeNum=999999&twoLetterCulture=en

### Exercise editor parameters (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/exercises/editor?cu=en
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### AI exercise search
POST {{host}}/api/exercises/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "exercises for lower back without equipment"
}

### AI exercise search - empty query (400)
POST {{host}}/api/exercises/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": ""
}

### ===== Blogs =====

### Blog list (culture: 1 = en, 2 = ru)
GET {{host}}/api/BlogPosts/search?culture=1&page=1&pageSize=10

### Blog post
GET {{host}}/api/BlogPosts?id=1

### Blog editor data (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/BlogPosts/editor
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mobile blog list
GET {{host}}/api/MobileBlogs?cultureId=1

### ===== Social workouts (api/v1/SocialWorkouts) =====

### Feed
GET {{host}}/api/v1/SocialWorkouts?page=1&pageSize=10

### Like a workout
POST {{host}}/api/v1/SocialWorkouts/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Unlike a workout
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/SocialWorkouts/1/like
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===== Mobile tokens =====

### Register or update a device token
POST {{host}}/api/MobileTokens
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "test-device-token",
  "language": "en",
  "zone": "+03:00"
}

### Report an app action (0 = Enter, 1 = Workout, 2 = Weight)
POST {{host}}/api/MobileTokens/action
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "test-device-token",
  "action": 1
}

### List tokens active in the last 30 days (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/MobileTokens?lastActiveDays=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Get one token (Admin)
GET {{host}}/api/MobileTokens/test-device-token
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### ===== User data =====

### Synced user repository
GET {{host}}/api/v1/UserRepo
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### User settings
GET {{host}}/api/UserSettings
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### YouTube videos for an exercise
GET {{host}}/api/YouTubeVideos/bench+press

### ===== Support =====

### Contact form
POST {{host}}/support/contact-me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test",
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "message": "Hello from the .http file"
}
